    "title": "Unrequested change to the publication gate; it blocks text that needs exactly 5 decode rounds, even with an empty denylist",
    "detail": "privateMatches is the shared denylist check used by the publication gates (audit.ts, engine checkPrivateText, repos.ts blob scan, github-notifier, land queue). The diff makes it decode repeatedly and adds \\uXXXX unescaping. If decoding hasn't settled after 5 rounds, it returns a synthetic entry 0, which blocks publication. The loop also gives up one round early: after the 5th decode it never checks whether a 6th would be stable, so input that settles after exactly 5 decodes is rejected. Entry 0 is returned even when private-strings.txt is empty. The MCP/digest feature didn't need this change to publication gating, and it makes the change bigger than the ~200-line budget."
   },
